# Nix leaves a `result` symlink behind after a local build. Nothing else in
# this directory is generated, and nothing in it is secret: secrets.age is
# encrypted (commit it), and stack.state.json, known_hosts, flake.lock and
# nodes/ are all records the whole team needs -- commit them too.
result

# secrets.py's save_secrets() writes through a same-directory temp file
# before its atomic rename -- a crash mid-save can leave one of these
# behind. Encrypted, like secrets.age itself, but still a stray write-ahead
# artefact that must never be committed.
secrets.age.*.tmp
